    "end": "He'll say it in the morning.",
    "caption": "Count the fish in the first frame.\n\nSimon is a cheerful little planet of six million people and one law, which is the game. Simon has been in charge since before he could talk, which was a very quiet year. Now he talks all the time. The whole planet hops to work, pudding comes first and the cat is Chancellor of the Exchequer. Grown-ups listen very carefully for the first two words.\n\nI've been holding mine for three days. Simon says I'm doing very well.\n\n(In France, the same game is called 'Jacques a dit': Jacques said. Nobody has told Simon about Jacques.)\n\nWould you have woken him?"
  },
